            "review_title": "Review at Nob Pub",
            "review_text": "Trail23407500710\n1 contribution\n0\nBest bar in Hanoi\nJun 2026 • Couples\nBeautiful, delicious fresh cocktails. Music at a decent level. What’s not to like? Proper cocktails made in 5-10 mins. This place deserves to be packed but it isn’t. We were a table of 2 and when the barman spotted a group of 12 coming in he ran over to take our next order before serving them all. Down a bit of a dark alley and upstairs but totally worth it\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 10, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
